@NotifyAiPowered_HostAddress = http://localhost:5052

### 1. Low Severity (Info) - Acknowledged, Not Forwarded
POST {{NotifyAiPowered_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "OrderService",
  "level": "Info",
  "title": "Order #54210 Processed",
  "message": "Order #54210 was successfully placed and inventory deducted.",
  "metadata": {
    "orderId": "54210",
    "amount": 250.00
  }
}

### 2. Warning Severity - Rate Limited, AI Analyzed & Forwarded to Discord
POST {{NotifyAiPowered_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "PaymentGateway",
  "level": "Warning",
  "title": "Stripe Gateway Elevated Latency",
  "message": "Average latency increased to 3200ms across 12 consecutive requests in us-east-1.",
  "metadata": {
    "provider": "Stripe",
    "avgLatencyMs": 3200,
    "environment": "production"
  }
}

### 3. Critical Severity - High Priority Alert Forwarded to Discord
POST {{NotifyAiPowered_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "DatabaseCluster",
  "level": "Critical",
  "title": "Postgres Primary Connection Pool Exhausted",
  "message": "Active connections reached 500/500 max limit. Incoming transactions are timing out with 504.",
  "metadata": {
    "cluster": "pg-primary-prod",
    "activeConnections": 500,
    "maxConnections": 500
  }
}

### 4. Invalid Request (Missing Required Fields)
POST {{NotifyAiPowered_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "",
  "level": "Warning"
}
